; specs/crons/railway-jobsearch-cron.t27 -- cron railway-cron/999/jobsearch-cron
; Source of truth for the job card on t27.ai (#/crons?cron=railway-cron/999/jobsearch-cron).
; The schedule lives in the Railway dashboard of project 999 and is not in any checkout.
; A cron CONTROLS skills: RUNS names the skill IDs it launches. It is empty
; unless the source evidently invokes one -- nothing here is inferred from a name.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

